  "name": "Crab Linguini with Parsley and Chilli",
  "text": "Crab Linguini with Parsley and Chilli\n\nPreparation time: 15 minutes\n\nCooking time: 10 minutes\n\nYield: 2\n\nIngredients\n\n160 g dried linguine,\n\n2 skinned deseeded and chopped vine ripened tomatoes,\n\n100 g white crab meat,\n\n1/2 tbsp chopped parsley,\n\n3/4 tbsp lemon juice,\n\n25 ml extra virgin olive oil,\n\npinch dried chilli flakes,\n\n1/2 finely chopped clove of garlic.\n\nPreparation\n\n1. Cook the pasta in a large pan of salted boiling water.\n\n2. Put the remaining ingredients into a small pan and warm through.\n\n3. Drain the pasta and mix with the sauce.",
  "prepTime": "PT15M",
  "cookTime": "PT10M",
  "recipeYield": "2",
  "recipeIngredient": [
    "160 g dried linguine,",
    "2 skinned deseeded and chopped vine ripened tomatoes,",
